    "body": "<!-- flclash:changelog:begin -->\n### Features\n- **access** Access control state shown in a bar at the bottom\n- **config** Optional general overrides; settings apply sooner\n- **dashboard** IP quality cached for 3 days; simpler Android dashboard\n- Update the core to mihomo v1.19.33\n- **tray** Colored tray status icons; monochrome option on macOS\n- **desktop** Sidebar blur; Windows fixes; keeps system proxies FlClash didn't set\n- **profiles** Profile QR codes, phone-to-TV links, more proxy fields\n- **proxies** Add proxies to local proxies; adjustable delay test timeout\n- **theme** Higher-contrast dark mode and a refreshed app icon\n- **ui** iOS-style docked search and menus; bar buttons lift on hover\n- **ui** iOS-style switches, stretchy sheets, menus and long-press reordering\n- **ui** Pages scroll under the Android navigation bar\n- **core** Clear the DNS cache by hand or on network change\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- **android** Opening the app no longer reloads a running VPN\n\n### Performance\n- **editor** Smoother editor for large files and in sheets\n\n<!-- flclash:changelog:end -->\n\n<!-- flclash:changelog:json\n{\"schemaVersion\":2,\"versions\":[{\"version\":\"0.9.2\",\"tag\":\"v0.9.2\",\"date\":\"2026-10-24\",\"prerelease\":false,\"groups\":[{\"type\":\"feat\",\"entries\":[{\"id\":\"e8aac17\",\"scope\":\"access\",\"text\":\"Access control state shown in a bar at the bottom\"},{\"id\":\"5d6552d\",\"scope\":\"config\",\"text\":\"Optional general overrides; settings apply sooner\"},{\"id\":\"8176cce\",\"scope\":\"dashboard\",\"text\":\"IP quality cached for 3 days; simpler Android dashboard\"},{\"id\":\"0817c3b\",\"text\":\"Update the core to mihomo v1.19.33\"},{\"id\":\"bbfafde\",\"scope\":\"tray\",\"text\":\"Colored tray status icons; monochrome option on macOS\"},{\"id\":\"6928521\",\"scope\":\"desktop\",\"text\":\"Sidebar blur; Windows fixes; keeps system proxies FlClash didn't set\"},{\"id\":\"eaaf3e3\",\"scope\":\"profiles\",\"text\":\"Profile QR codes, phone-to-TV links, more proxy fields\"},{\"id\":\"0f9f89c\",\"scope\":\"proxies\",\"text\":\"Add proxies to local proxies; adjustable delay test timeout\"},{\"id\":\"a4fc067\",\"scope\":\"theme\",\"text\":\"Higher-contrast dark mode and a refreshed app icon\"},{\"id\":\"0d98a9d\",\"scope\":\"ui\",\"text\":\"iOS-style docked search and menus; bar buttons lift on hover\"},{\"id\":\"ae902ed\",\"scope\":\"ui\",\"text\":\"iOS-style switches, stretchy sheets, menus and long-press reordering\"},{\"id\":\"4837fb3\",\"scope\":\"ui\",\"text\":\"Pages scroll under the Android navigation bar\"},{\"id\":\"09e7e56\",\"scope\":\"core\",\"text\":\"Clear the DNS cache by hand or on network change\"}]},{\"type\":\"fix\",\"entries\":[{\"id\":\"99b3381\",\"scope\":\"android\",\"text\":\"Opening the app no longer reloads a running VPN\"}]},{\"type\":\"perf\",\"entries\":[{\"id\":\"7035edd\",\"scope\":\"editor\",\"text\":\"Smoother editor for large files and in sheets\"}]}]}]}\n-->\n<div align=center>\n\n[![Release Downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/chen08209/FlClash/v0.9.2/total?style=flat-square&logo=github)](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/chen08209/FlClash/v0.9.2/)\n\n</div>\n\n**Download based on your OS:**\n\n<div align=left>\n<table>\n    <thead align=left>\n        <tr>\n            <th>OS</th>\n            <th>Download</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody align=left>\n        <tr>\n        <td>Android</td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.2/FlClash-0.9.2-android-arm64-v8a.apk\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/APK-ARMv8-168039.svg?logo=android\"></a><br>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.2/FlClash-0.9.2-android-armeabi-v7a.apk\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/APK-ARMv7-45bf55.svg?logo=android\"></a><br>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.2/FlClash-0.9.2-android-x86_64.apk\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/APK-x64-96ed89.svg?logo=android\"></a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Windows</td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.2/FlClash-0.9.2-windows-amd64-setup.exe\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Setup-x64-2d7d9a.svg?logo=windows\"></a><br>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.2/FlClash-0.9.2-windows-amd64.zip\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Portable-x64-67b7d1.svg?logo=windows\"></a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>macOS</td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.2/FlClash-0.9.2-macos-arm64.dmg\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DMG-Apple%20Silicon-%23000000.svg?logo=apple\"></a><br>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.2/FlClash-0.9.2-macos-amd64.dmg\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DMG-Intel%20X64-%2300A9E0.svg?logo=apple\"></a><br>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Linux</td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.2/FlClash-0.9.2-linux-amd64.AppImage\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/AppImage-x64-f84e29.svg?logo=linux\"> </a><br>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.2/FlClash-0.9.2-linux-amd64.deb\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DebPackage-x64-FF9966.svg?logo=debian\"> </a><br>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.2/FlClash-0.9.2-linux-amd64.rpm\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/RpmPackage-x64-F1B42F.svg?logo=redhat\"> </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n\n**List of all changes:** [Cha